Getting the source for the Cytoscape.js graphing library.

1. Download the source tarball for the desired release from the project's
   GitHub Releases page:

    https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape.js/releases

2. Unpack the gzipped tarball. The release already includes a built dist
   directory containing the distributable files (cytoscape.umd.js,
   cytoscape.min.js, and others), so there is nothing to build.

4. Copy the files from the unpacked release's dist directory to the RT
   directories shown.

    cp dist/cytoscape.umd.js ~/rt-dir/devel/third-party/cytoscape/
    cp dist/cytoscape.min.js ~/rt-dir/share/static/js/
